   "note": "estimated - 116 cables, FS states none for the USCMH finger ducts. The channel clear cross-section, 66.8 mm high (the duct guide) by 69.75 mm deep (the well floor to the underside of the cover), divided by 39.9 mm2 a cable: the pooled ratio of the three FS ABS finger ducts whose capacity FS does state (CMH-SFD1U 48 in 1850 mm2, CMH-DFD1U 96 in 3700, CMH-SFD2U 124 in 5143). Those agree to within 8%, which is this figure's uncertainty at best; this is a different moulding. Across every FS manager the ratio runs 38.5 to 82.8 (the HD and UHD lines scale per rack unit), so it is fitted on the ABS ducts only."
  },
  "chassis": {
