   "note": "drawing - THE BODY BETWEEN THE EARS. The specification table gives 88.0 x 482.2 x 107.0 mm (3.46 x 18.98 x 4.21 in) and the front view 88.8 high and 484.84 across the cover; 88.8 is taken. The width between the ear folds is the USCMH-SFDABS1U's 436.3, whose top view this one repeats; the ears are not drawn. `depth` STATES THE VENDOR OVERALL 107.0: THE PRODUCT SELECTOR'S 2.81 in [71 mm] IS THE PROJECTION IN FRONT OF THE EARS, the 71.45 of the top view and the 2.81 in on the dimensioned render, not the depth; the table's 4.21 in and the drawing's 107.00 agree, and the ribbed base stands 35.55 behind the ears."
  },
  "color": {
