   "note": "FIGURES FROM THE VENDOR DRAWING. The FS 1&2RU Horizontal Single Sided Manager datasheet (USCMH-SFDABS1U and -2U) has a specification table and, per model, a top view, a front view and a side view in millimetres. Rendered at 600 dpi, the front view is 4.14 px/mm across its 484.84 and 4.17 down its 88.8, under 1 per cent apart, so it is orthographic. The top view is the USCMH-SFDABS1U top view with a deeper cover: 107.00 (Ref) overall, 71.45 in front of the plane of the ears and 49.09 (Ref) from the ears to the back of the cover; the side view's 75.80 is the 71.45 plus the same 4.35 as on the 1U. The renders of #317017 are the second reading; gallery image 5 is the front with the cover off, straight on, and its ear holes 76 mm apart read 3.16 px/mm down against 3.16 across."
